&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DNP, FNP, ENP, or PA from accredited program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Board Certification (NCCPA or AANP or ANCC)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years experience in outpatient Family Medicine, Internal Medicine, or Primary Care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience delivering virtual care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Licensed in a minimum of 2 core Oscar States:
