&lt;p&gt;The Manager serves as a central business partner and works collaboratively with other departments involved in accreditation activities. This individual drives cross-functional workgroups, manages complex annual review cycles, translates accreditation requirements into operational action, and ensures timely, accurate documentation and reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
