&lt;li&gt;Develop company profiles, target-screening criteria, and initial assessments of prospective acquisition candidates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support financial, commercial, and strategic evaluations, including market sizing, growth outlook, synergies, risks, and valuation considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze potential partnership, joint-venture, and strategic-alliance opportunities as alternatives or complements to acquisitions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build clear, executive-ready presentations, investment memos, and recommendation materials for senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross-functional stakeholders—including finance, operations, product, legal, and business development—to gather inputs and assess opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
