&lt;li&gt;Follow up on labs, imaging, and closed loop communication with patients and other providers as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use tooling to allow virtual &quot;exams&quot; including remote home monitoring equipment, remote physical exam, remote point of care diagnostics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in collaborative care model with various care team members including but not limited to registered nurses, medical assistants, PCPs, behavioral health clinicians, and clinical supervisor where applicable&lt;/li&gt;
