&lt;li&gt;12+ years of quantitative analysis in the healthcare industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of collaborating and influencing an Executive Leadership Committee.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in a pricing role, or a related analytics-driven leadership role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong government programs risk adjustment subject matter expertise, preferably in ACA Marketplace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
