&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Location: &lt;/strong&gt;This is a remote position, open to candidates who reside in: Atlanta, Georgia. You will be fully remote; however, our approach to work may adapt over time. Future models could potentially involve a hybrid presence at the hub office associated with your metro area. #LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
