&lt;li&gt;Create routines that create collaboration within and outside of department&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a vision of clarity and ensure stability and scalability within the direct area of influence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate the proper approach with implementation of Continuous Improvement Tools both internal to our organization and in consideration of industry best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement core metric tracking and tool using present in a LEAN-based operational environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide direction, mentorship, and influence regarding the necessity of process improvement work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop appropriate bench and develop organizational talent through clear goals and healthy accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compliance with all applicable laws and regulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
