&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s Degree or 4+ years of commensurate experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of program and project management in the healthcare space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years experience in change management and process improvement and implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of professional experience in provider data or provider network operations within a health insurance company&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
