&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience independently managing complex client, partner, account, or implementation portfolios with responsibility for escalations, cross-functional execution, and senior stakeholder communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning complex external client or partner relationships and leading executive-level communications, escalations, and business reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading complex, cross-functional launches, implementations, or service initiatives with multiple stakeholders, dependencies, risks, and business commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing or improving client-service standards, playbooks, governance practices, KPIs, partner-health measures, or escalation processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using client, service, adoption, or performance data to identify risks and opportunities, set priorities, and drive measurable improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience presenting recommendations, performance, risks, and tradeoffs to senior or executive audiences and partnering across Sales, Product, Engineering, Operations, Finance, Legal, or related functions.&lt;/li&gt;
