&lt;li&gt;Experience managing strategic relationships with FMOs, agencies, brokers, carriers, or other insurance distribution partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ACA marketplace, EDE, ICHRA, supplemental products, producer onboarding, agency hierarchies, or book-of-business migrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SaaS platforms, CRM workflows, APIs, data imports, reporting, or operational integrations that support partner implementation and service delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
