&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with healthcare claims, clinical workflows, care navigation, or health insurance economics, including how coverage, cost and access barriers affect members’ ability to get appropriate care and follow through on treatment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning recommender, search, ads, ML-platform, or applied-AI product capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
