&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical and quantitative skills; proven experience using data to identify opportunities, test hypotheses and evaluate success, including investigating individual member experiences and broader population patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as an end-to-end thinker; the ability to look at a problem and create a solution all the way from top-level goals to smaller details.&lt;/li&gt;
